@page "/"
@* The landing page shows no client data, so it is open to anyone. It says what the site does here:
   on the demo every step works; elsewhere, until sign-in exists, no campaign can be opened. *@
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]
@inject SiteMode Site

<PageTitle>Neelam campaigns</PageTitle>

<h1>Neelam campaigns</h1>

@if (Site.IsDemo)
{
    <p>
        Write a campaign from one of your templates, see the checks as you go, approve it, and copy it
        into Square. Start in <a href="campaigns">Campaigns</a>, or keep your photos in
        <a href="images">Images</a> and the offers you write again and again in <a href="known-items">Known items</a>.
    </p>
}
else
{
    <p>Sign-in is not set up yet, so this app does not show or change any campaigns.</p>
}

<p><a href="how-it-works">How a campaign gets from idea to inbox</a></p>
